        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to enjoy alone at night, sitting at your PC with a cup of coffee in hand—<strong>“Aria:‖”</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling rhythm action game where you perform freely to flowing classical music, moving in time with the melody.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid pitfalls and obstacles as you aim to reach the goal with a beautiful, seamless performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small monochrome tale of a girl who has lost her memories, moving forward to learn where she came from—<br>for herself, and for someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be a simple game, but playing so the music flows cleanly makes it challenging.<br>Please experience this calm, bittersweet, and slightly whimsical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Side-scrolling Rhythm Action<br><strong>Players:</strong> 1 (Solo only)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 3 hours<br><strong>Supported OS:</strong> Windows<br><strong>Controls:</strong> Controller, Keyboard (Controller recommended)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action　　　　   Controller　　　　 Keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk　　　　　  D-Pad Left/Right　A, D / ←, →</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash　　　　　  □ Button　　　     Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump　　　　　 ✕ Button　　　      Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause　　　　　Options Button　   Esc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate　　　  D-Pad　　　　 　   W, A, S, D / ↑, ←, ↓, →</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm　　　   ◯ Button　　　　   Space / Enter / F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Scenario　△ Button　　　　   E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Scenario　 Select Button　　   Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All key bindings can be changed from the Options menu.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to enjoy alone at night, sitting at your PC with a cup of coffee in hand—<strong>“Aria:‖”</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling rhythm action game where you perform freely to flowing classical music, moving in time with the melody.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid pitfalls and obstacles as you aim to reach the goal with a beautiful, seamless performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small monochrome tale of a girl who has lost her memories, moving forward to learn where she came from—<br>for herself, and for someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be a simple game, but playing so the music flows cleanly makes it challenging.<br>Please experience this calm, bittersweet, and slightly whimsical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Side-scrolling Rhythm Action<br><strong>Players:</strong> 1 (Solo only)<br><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 3 hours<br><strong>Supported OS:</strong> Windows<br><strong>Controls:</strong> Controller, Keyboard (Controller recommended)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action　　　　   Controller　　　　 Keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk　　　　　  D-Pad Left/Right　A, D / ←, →</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash　　　　　  □ Button　　　     Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump　　　　　 ✕ Button　　　      Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause　　　　　Options Button　   Esc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate　　　  D-Pad　　　　 　   W, A, S, D / ↑, ←, ↓, →</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm　　　   ◯ Button　　　　   Space / Enter / F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Scenario　△ Button　　　　   E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Scenario　 Select Button　　   Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All key bindings can be changed from the Options menu.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "When you were little, did you ever make your fingers act like tiny people, letting them hop and dance to the music in the car as the scenery rolled by? A world that begins with lines and sound. That feeling is what Aria:‖ is all about. A quiet little game meant to make you smile.",
